#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:809
msgid ""
"A clean, data-driven receipt using the $receipt_data payload. Good starting point for custom templates."
msgstr ""
"Un comprovant net, basat en dades, que utilitza el fitxer $receipt_data. Bon punt d'inici per a plantilles personalitzades."

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:816
msgid "Thermal Printer Receipt"
msgstr "Comprovant d'impressora tèrmica"

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:817
msgid ""
"Narrow monospace layout designed for 80mm/58mm thermal receipt printers. Includes tax ID, itemised tax breakdown, and tendered/change lines."
msgstr ""
"Disseny de tipus monoespai estret disenyat per a impressores de comprovants tèrmics de 80 mm/58 mm. Inclou l'identificador fiscal, desglose fiscal per articles i línies de pagament i canvi."

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:825
msgid ""
"Shows items without prices. Displays the customer note as a gift message. Useful for gift wrapping counters."
msgstr ""
"Mostra els articles sense preus. Mostra la nota del client com a missatge de regal. Útil per a enquadres de regal."

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:832
msgid "Simple Receipt (Logicless)"
msgstr "Comprovant senzill (sense lògica)"

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:833
msgid ""
"Full receipt using the logicless template engine with section blocks for line items, payments, and conditionals. No PHP required — just HTML and CSS."
msgstr ""
"Comprovant complet que utilitza l'entorn de plantilla sense lògica amb blocs de secció per a articles, pagaments i condicionals. No es requereix PHP — només HTML i CSS."

